{
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "meeting_at_a_glance",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Sam Reyes, Hannah Voss, Maya Okafor, and Jonas Lindqvist are meeting to walk through the revised PPA pricing and the board pre-read ahead of the board meeting.",
          "citations": [
            "cal:M2"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "client_snapshot",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Brightmoor Renewables has engaged Northwind Advisory for market pricing analysis, PPA negotiation strategy, risk assessment of contract structures, and drafting a formal board paper.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The total fixed fee for the engagement is £48,000, exclusive of VAT and pre-approved expenses.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The fee is payable in two equal instalments of £24,000, with 50% due upon formal project commencement and 50% upon delivery of the final board paper.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The final board paper is due on 20 March 2026.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D7",
            "email:E38"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The board is scheduled to meet on 24 March 2026.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E38"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Financial close for the project is targeted for 30 June 2026.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E41"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashgrove Bank requires the project to secure 70% contracted revenue before financial close.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sources disagree on the Fenmoor project capacity: the document from 20 January 2026 and news from 2 March 2026 state it is 180 MW.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D8",
            "news:N26"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The other source says the capacity was revised to 165 MW on 19 February 2026 due to a new turbine layout.",
          "citations": [
            "chat:C18"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "recent_news",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "On 18 December 2025, Brightmoor Renewables announced the completion of the 52 MW Ashby solar farm.",
          "citations": [
            "news:N1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 30 January 2026, the local planning authority granted consent for the development of the Fenmoor wind farm.",
          "citations": [
            "news:N10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 2 March 2026, Brightmoor Renewables signed a grid-connection agreement for the Fenmoor wind farm project.",
          "citations": [
            "news:N26"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As of 2 March 2026, full energisation of the Fenmoor wind farm is planned for late 2027.",
          "citations": [
            "news:N26"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "where_we_left_off",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "On 12 February 2026, Jonas Lindqvist noted that Ashgrove Bank requires the PPA to be fully signed off before financial close.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E41"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 24 February 2026, Maya Okafor indicated that the proposed 74/MWh pricing floor is above the 71/MWh limit approved by finance.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E51"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 27 February 2026, Jonas Lindqvist requested that all figures in the board pre-read remain consistent with the lender model.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E56"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 2 March 2026, Elena Marchetti announced the grid connection agreement for Fenmoor was signed.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E59"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 5 March 2026, Jonas Lindqvist reported he was unable to access the shared project folder due to permission errors.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E63"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 6 March 2026, Hannah Voss advised leading the pre-read with the pricing floor logic and pressing for technical study results.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E65"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "open_items",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Sam Reyes promised on 20 January 2026 to circulate the agenda for weekly Thursday calls twenty-four hours in advance.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maya Okafor promised on 24 February 2026 to send the grid-connection study by 6 March 2026 at the latest.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E51"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maya Okafor requested on 24 February 2026 a reworked sensitivity table reflecting the pricing floor friction before the board pre-read is circulated.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E51"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The final board paper must be ready by 20 March 2026 for internal review.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E38",
            "doc:D7"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "attendees",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Sam Reyes is a Senior Consultant at Northwind Advisory who serves as the day-to-day lead on all three engagements.",
          "citations": [
            "contact:P1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hannah Voss is a Partner at Northwind Advisory and the senior sponsor who leads the Brightmoor Renewables relationship.",
          "citations": [
            "contact:P4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maya Okafor is the Head of Commercial at Brightmoor Renewables, leads the PPA negotiation, and prefers short bullet updates.",
          "citations": [
            "contact:P8",
            "email:E51"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonas Lindqvist is the Chief Financial Officer at Brightmoor Renewables and owns lender relations and the board paper.",
          "citations": [
            "contact:P9",
            "email:E63"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "talking_points_and_risks",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "The proposed 74/MWh pricing floor exceeds the 71/MWh limit approved by the Brightmoor finance team.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E51"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Delays in receiving updated operations and maintenance assumptions and revised grid connection timelines may impact the sensitivity analysis.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D16"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sources disagree on the Fenmoor project capacity: the baseline for revenue modelling was set at 180 MW on 20 January 2026.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D8",
            "news:N26"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The other source says the capacity was revised to 165 MW on 19 February 2026.",
          "citations": [
            "chat:C18"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonas Lindqvist reported on 5 March 2026 that he cannot access the shared project folder for the PPA work.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E63"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The PPA must be fully signed off before the 30 June 2026 financial close target to satisfy Ashgrove Bank requirements.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E41"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
